      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::This bloody device seems functional, despite having suffered some damage. The screen is scratched, but not cracked, and the left side of the mobile computer's body has been dented in such manner as to suggest that it was grazed by a passing bullet.

You can use the touch-sensitive screen to select one of the displayed icons.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
