      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::You scroll through a decent selection of songs, some familiar, others not. Out of the unfamiliar ones, the ones that instantly draw your attention are "Southern love" by the Martyrs and "Stillborn" by Gronothrakht. You play them one after the other: The first is a gentle, romantic, but still somewhat deep ballad, while the other one makes your ears bleed and forces you to turn it off after five seconds.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
