        <mda:meta type="pos_id">44</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Met the pipeworker again at the Core City metro station. He pulled out a rancid pig intestine out of a bag and wanted to sell it to me. Also had a liver on a skewer. If we hadn't been at the station, I'd have Chad and Splinter zone him out.

Note to self: Have Al Fabet killed the next time he shows his face.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a23" name="=&gt;a23">
      <mda:metadata>
